    "detailed_description": "The Argument Solver allows you to quickly solver your issues between 2 Parties in a very primate way.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEasily create a lobby and be placed into our courtroom inspired Arena, where you can throw weapons at each other. Make sure you have a evasive defense as you only have 1 life.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Argument Solver is perfect for all kinds of head to head debates, below we have list a couple of our favorites:<br />\r\n - Can't decide between which MOBA to play<br />\r\n - Help your partner decide where to eat by fighting over 2 options<br />\r\n - Crippling debt from a long custody battle or watch your parents duke it out for your ownership",
